### ============================================================================
### PENGUJIAN REST API - PORTAL ASPIRASI & LAPOR DESA
### Gunakan VS Code extension "REST Client" atau salin data ini ke Postman
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Test Server Berjalan
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test Koneksi PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/db-test
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### REST API: LAPORAN (REPORTS) - Sesuai Ketentuan Tugas
### ============================================================================

### 3. GET => Dapatkan semua data laporan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET => Dapatkan data laporan berdasarkan parameter status (opsional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports?status=Diproses
Accept: application/json

### 5. GET => Dapatkan data laporan berdasarkan ID pada parameter URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. POST => Membuat data baru disimpan ke Database
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "Jembatan Kayu Dusun Utara Lapuk dan Membahayakan",
  "description": "Kayu penahan jembatan di Dusun Utara sudah banyak yang lapuk, mohon perbaikan segera sebelum musim hujan.",
  "location": "Jembatan Kali Kulon Dusun Utara"
}

### 7. PUT => Memperbarui data laporan (contoh: update status dan catatan)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Selesai"
}

### 8. DELETE => Menghapus data laporan berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/3
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### REST API: KATEGORI (CATEGORIES)
### ============================================================================

### 9. GET => Dapatkan semua kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 10. GET => Dapatkan kategori berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 11. POST => Tambah kategori baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kesehatan",
  "description": "Laporan layanan posyandu dan kesehatan masyarakat desa"
}
